														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1072112">
									

<p>And with that in mind, why are we defaulting to humans for initial testing? Seems a bit wasteful, even if D-class are apparently a dime a dozen in the universe the Foundation occupies. Most of the tests performed here could just as easily be performed on a rat or an apple. I realize that makes the experiments less fun to read, but it's pretty harmful to suspension of disbelief.</p>
<p>I still enjoyed it enough to upvote, but it's something to consider.</p>

